# Netlify response headers.
#
# Three-tier Content-Security-Policy strategy:
#
# 1. Wildcard (/*): baseline CSP for all static pages.
#    connect-src intentionally omits 'self' so no script on any page can
#    POST user content to the same-origin Netlify Forms endpoint. All
#    singleton security headers (X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options,
#    Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy) live here only; page-specific
#    blocks must NOT repeat them or Netlify will emit duplicates.
#
# 2. Contact pages (/contact.html, /contact): the one place an intentional
#    form POST to same-origin is needed. Override CSP to allow
#    form-action 'self' so the native Netlify form POST works without JS.
#    connect-src still omits 'self'.
#
# 3. Builder/Verify pages (/app.html, /app, /verify.html, /verify): explicit
#    CSP override that matches the wildcard exactly, pinning the no-connect-src
#    guarantee for evidence-handling pages against future wildcard changes.
#    This is the on-page enforcement of "evidence files never leave the browser".
#
# 4. AI Review Lab (/ai-lab.html, /ai-lab): loads Transformers.js + ONNX
#    WebAssembly runtime from jsDelivr and DOWNLOADS public model weights from
#    Hugging Face. script-src adds jsDelivr, 'wasm-unsafe-eval' (WASM
#    instantiation), 'unsafe-eval' (fallback for browsers that don't yet honour
#    wasm-unsafe-eval alone), and blob: (ONNX Runtime blob: workers).
#    connect-src adds jsDelivr + Hugging Face model hosts + blob:/data: (WASM
#    binary), and worker-src allows blob: workers. connect-src still OMITS
#    'self', so pasted message text can never be POSTed back to our own origin.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://fonts.googleapis.com https://fonts.gstatic.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()

